  "purpose": "Maps the 51 Equity Uprise IT/OT labs to the industry certifications they help prepare for. These are not federal credentials and Equity Uprise issues none of them.",
  "credential_is_not_competency": true,
  "authority_rules": [
    "Issuer pages and published exam objectives control exam codes, prices and renewal; prices here are approximate and secondary-sourced.",
    "A lab alignment means the lab practises skills named in that objective. It is not exam coverage, a voucher or a pass.",
    "Learner-facing copy says 'prepares you for' and links the issuer; it never says certified.",
    "Objective IDs are validated against the PRIM3 ledgers in docs/prim3 (A+ V15, Network+ N10-009, Security+ SY0-701)."
  ],
